<%- include("partials/header", { title: "AI Trends", pageTitle: "Real-Time Data in AI Systems" }) %>

<section>
    <h2>How AI Uses Live Data</h2>
    <article>
        <p>
            Many AI systems depend on live information from web APIs. Real-time data can be used in smart assistants,
            forecasting tools, recommendation platforms, and decision-support systems.
        </p>
        <p>
            The data below comes from a live Web API is loaded in the backend through
            <strong>index.mjs</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
            This example shows how software can retrieve fresh information from the internet and display it dynamically.
        </p>
        <img class="page-image" src="/img/ai-trends.jpg" alt="Visualization of real-time data used in AI systems">
    </article>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Example of Live API Data</h2>
    <% if (apiData) { %>
        <article>
            <h3>Advice from a Live API</h3>
            <p><strong>Advice:</strong> <%= apiData.advice %></p>
        </article>
    <% } else { %>
        <article>
            <p><%= error %></p>
        </article>
    <% } %>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Source</h2>
    <ul class="source-list">
        <li>
            <a href="https://api.adviceslip.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Advice Slip API
            </a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>